;
; How Lore keeps one leave for the companion in MYRA (lore_rules.h LR3):
; its number (at most 999), the most private kind of space it reaches (0
; home, 1 office, 2 team, 3 cloudtop, 4 park), how many segments deep its
; folder is (zxvd's index goes 32 deep), and when it was given and when it
; expires, in seconds since 1970 (12 digits). The folder's name is text and
; stays with the model; Lore asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps
; a leave.
^ZXLORE(leave:i3) = reach:i1! ^ depth:i2! ^ given:i12! ^ expires:i12!
